('c266b91e-3295-5b97-8978-133ca5566627', '3fd36cc2-d7e7-4424-b4b5-11a4a8b7ac04', '9a577035-5226-4d06-b1f8-39a2b1f93b0a', 'a-level', '25.2', '9702 coursebook 25.2 · Orbiting charged particles', 34, 34, 'A charged particle circles with radius 1.5 cm in a uniform field. Its speed is tripled. Calculate the new radius, in cm.', NULL, 2, 'numeric'::answer_type, '4.5 cm', 'cm', false, NULL, false, NULL, 'r ∝ v, so r = 1.5 × 3 = 4.5 cm. Mark scheme (3 marks). C1: r ∝ v. C1: value. A1: r = 4.5 cm.', 3, NULL, NULL),
('f1f8c586-960d-5229-9ac5-c42ba6213f69', '3fd36cc2-d7e7-4424-b4b5-11a4a8b7ac04', '9a577035-5226-4d06-b1f8-39a2b1f93b0a', 'a-level', '25.2', '9702 coursebook 25.2 · Orbiting charged particles', 35, 35, 'A uniform magnetic field points into the page. A particle moving across the page curves clockwise. What is the sign of its charge?', NULL, 2, 'multiple_choice'::answer_type, 'Negative', NULL, false, NULL, false, NULL, 'For a positive charge, F = Qv × B with B into the page turns the path anticlockwise; clockwise means negative. Mark scheme (4 marks). C1: left-hand rule for positive charge. C1: positive gives anticlockwise. C1: so negative. A1: B (Negative).', 4, '<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 320 260" role="img" aria-labelledby="fga31c4bfa-t fga31c4bfa-d" style="font-family:ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,''Segoe UI'',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;max-width:100%;height:auto"><title id="fga31c4bfa-t">Curving path</title><desc id="fga31c4bfa-d">A uniform field directed into the page; a charged particle moving across the page follows a clockwise circular path.</desc><line x1="30" y1="27.5" x2="38" y2="35.5" style="stroke:var(--fig-muted,#6b7280);stroke-width:1.4;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="30" y1="35.5" x2="38" y2="27.5" style="stroke:var(--fig-muted,#6b7280);stroke-width:1.4;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="30" y1="62.5" x2="38" y2="70.5" style="stroke:var(--fig-muted,#6b7280);stroke-width:1.4;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="30" y1="70.5" x2="38" y2="62.5" style="stroke:var(--fig-muted,#6b7280);stroke-width:1.4;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="30" y1="97.5" x2="38" y2="105.5" style="stroke:var(--fig-muted,#6b7280);stroke-width:1.4;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="30" y1="105.5" x2="38" y2="97.5" style="stroke:var(--fig-muted,#6b7280);stroke-width:1.4;fill:none;stroke-linecap