('5c541216-c892-5d12-a29a-68bae8dbbc5d', '3fd36cc2-d7e7-4424-b4b5-11a4a8b7ac04', '939a9c6c-194e-484e-83e2-0ab494ffa0d4', 'a-level', '25.3', '9702 coursebook 25.3 · Electric and magnetic fields', 26, 26, 'A beam contains protons and α-particles all moving at the speed E/B selected by a velocity selector. Which particles pass through undeflected?', NULL, 2, 'multiple_choice'::answer_type, 'Both the protons and the α-particles', NULL, false, NULL, false, NULL, 'v = E/B does not depend on charge or mass. Mark scheme (3 marks). C1: EQ = BQv. C1: Q cancels. A1: C (Both the protons and the α-particles).', 3, NULL, NULL),
('9589ad63-ddc2-543f-97eb-159d9d3f6446', '3fd36cc2-d7e7-4424-b4b5-11a4a8b7ac04', '939a9c6c-194e-484e-83e2-0ab494ffa0d4', 'a-level', '25.3', '9702 coursebook 25.3 · Electric and magnetic fields', 27, 27, 'A selector has E = 3.0 × 10⁴ V m⁻¹ and B = 0.10 T. A proton enters at 4.5 × 10⁵ m s⁻¹. Calculate the resultant force on it, in units of 10⁻¹⁵ N. Take e = 1.60 × 10⁻¹⁹ C.', NULL, 2, 'numeric'::answer_type, '2.4', '10⁻¹⁵ N', false, NULL, false, NULL, 'F_B = 0.10 × 1.60 × 10⁻¹⁹ × 4.5 × 10⁵ = 7.2 × 10⁻¹⁵ N. F_E = 1.60 × 10⁻¹⁹ × 3.0 × 10⁴ = 4.8 × 10⁻¹⁵ N. Resultant = 7.2 × 10⁻¹⁵ − 4.8 × 10⁻¹⁵ = 2.40 × 10⁻¹⁵ N, in the direction of the magnetic force. Mark scheme (3 marks). C1: both forces. C1: difference. A1: F = 2.4 × 10⁻¹⁵ N.', 3, '<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 440 242" role="img" aria-labelledby="fgb01ea06a-t fgb01ea06a-d" style="font-family:ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,''Segoe UI'',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;max-width:100%;height:auto"><title id="fgb01ea06a-t">Velocity selector</title><desc id="fgb01ea06a-d">A velocity selector with E = 3.0 × 10⁴ V m⁻¹ and B = 0.10 T into the page; a proton enters from the left at 4.5 × 10⁵ m s⁻¹.</desc><rect x="120" y="42" width="220" height="8" rx="0" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:0.9;fill:var(--fig-fill,rgba(29,78,216,0.10));stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><rect x="120" y="160" width="220" height="8" rx="0" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:0.9;fill:var(--fig-fill,rgba(29,78,216,0.10));stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><text x="108" y="46" font-size="14" text-anchor="end" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor;font-weight:700">+</text><text x="108" y="164" font-size="14" text-anchor="end" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor;font-weight:700">−</text><line x1="139.3" y1="68.3" x2="147.3" y2="76.3" style="stroke:var(--fig-muted,#6b7280);stroke-width:1.4;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="139.3" y1